DESIGN SPECIFICATION :

-Mobile Station (MS):	Handset plus SIM; initiates and receives calls over the air interface
-BTS: Radio transceiver that serves one cell
-BSC:	Controls several BTSs; radio channel allocation and handoff control
-MSC:	Switching, call set-up, mobility management, interface to PSTN
-HLR/VLR:	Permanent and visited-area subscriber databases
-PSTN:	Fixed telephone network for external calls
